Standuppp 站站鸭
Modifications copyright 2026 584144 (https://github.com/584144), same licence (GPL-3.0).

A modified fork of sigstop (upstream commit 651a6d8), renamed as upstream's trademark
policy asks: https://github.com/Mohamed-Elshesheny/sigstop/blob/main/TRADEMARK.md
Changes, October 2026:

  - A break during which the keyboard or mouse was in use for more than a minute
    (setting maxActiveDuringBreakSeconds) does not count.
  - A desktop pet (a plush duckling, or a ghost) whose mood follows the work clock.
  - Fifteen synthesized comic sketches, one at random on the first reminder of a break.
  - A Chinese interface, chosen by a language setting.
  - New name, bundle id (io.github.584144.standuppp), icon and colours; no Dock icon by
    default; the upstream update feed and release tooling removed.
